   ```sh
   terraform apply
   ```

## Variables

- `region`: The AWS region to deploy the VPC.
- `vpc_cidr`: The CIDR block for the VPC.
- `public_subnet_cidr`: The CIDR block for the public subnet.
- `availability_zone`: The availability zone for the subnet.
- `ami_id`: The AMI ID for the EC2 instance.
- `instance_type`: The instance type for the EC2 instance.

## Outputs

- `vpc_id`: The ID of the VPC.
- `public_subnet_id`: The ID of the public subnet.
- `ec2_instance_id`: The ID of the public EC2 instance.
- `shadow_admin_role_arn`: The ARN of the shadow admin IAM role.
